/* The battle in the original look: the partner's HP and MP at the top right, the finisher gauge under them, the
   tamer's commands at the top left, the enemies' HP bars and the end boxes, all over the undimmed arena.

   Positions are the captures' (battle_hud, battle_hud_enemy_hp_bar, battle_hud_finisher_ready, battle_end_box*):
   the decompilation's screen coordinates less 6 lines in battle. On a wide screen the panels keep to their edges at
   the original's distances; the end boxes stay in the middle. */

#fight {
	background-color: transparent;
}

/* ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   The partner's bars (BI_IN; command_menu.c and the battle HUD): each the 104 x 8 frame at x 206, y 14 and 26 (the
   decompilation's 20 and 32), the icon (11 x 11) at the frame's (4, -2), the fill from the frame's (18, 3), 50 pixels
   at most and 2 tall (HP #f8d8c8 over #d04848, MP #c8e0f0 over #0068b8), and the value's four digits from the frame's
   x 73 to x 99 (the capture's x 305), in the original's small digits, 8 pixels tall (24dp). The panel ends 10 pixels from the right edge. The partner's name and status are not shown, as the original. */

#partner-panel {
	position: absolute;
	right: 30dp;
	top: 42dp;
	left: auto;
	bottom: auto;
	width: 312dp;
	padding: 0;
	border-radius: 0;
	border-width: 0;
	background-color: transparent;
}

.fighter {
	margin: 0;
	padding: 0;
	border-radius: 0;
	border-width: 0;
	background-color: transparent;
}

.partner .fighter-head {
	display: none;
}

.partner .bar-row {
	display: block;
	position: relative;
	width: 312dp;
	height: 24dp;
	margin: 0 0 12dp 0;
	decorator: image(battle-bar-frame);
}

.partner .bar-label {
	position: absolute;
	left: 12dp;
	top: -6dp;
	width: 33dp;
	height: 33dp;
	font-size: 0;
	color: transparent;
}

#fighter-0-hp-label { decorator: image(battle-hp); }
#fighter-0-mp-label { decorator: image(battle-mp); }

.partner .bar {
	position: absolute;
	left: 54dp;
	top: 9dp;
	width: 150dp;
	height: 6dp;
	margin: 0;
	border-radius: 0;
	border-width: 0;
	background-color: transparent;
}

.partner .fill {
	height: 3dp;
	border-radius: 0;
}

.partner .hp .fill {
	border-top: 3dp #f8d8c8;
	background-color: #d04848;
}

.partner .mp .fill {
	border-top: 3dp #c8e0f0;
	background-color: #0068b8;
}

.partner .bar-value {
	position: absolute;
	left: 219dp;
	top: 0;
	width: 78dp;
	font-size: 24dp;
	line-height: 24dp;
	text-align: right;
	color: #d0d0d0;
}

.fighter.fainted {
	opacity: 0.5;
}

/* The finisher (command_menu.c: 8 segments from x 215, y 35, in the yellows #f8e058 to #c8b028): the original fills
   the letters of its word one by one (capture battle_hud_finisher_ready, "FIN"); its 8 segments are blocks here, the
   word's letters being part of the sprite. */
#finisher {
	width: auto;
	margin: 0 0 0 27dp;
	padding: 0;
	border-width: 0;
	background-color: transparent;
}

#finisher-label {
	display: none;
}

.segment {
	width: 18dp;
	height: 21dp;
	margin: 0;
	border-radius: 0;
	background-color: transparent;
}

.segment.filled, #finisher.ready .segment {
	background-color: transparent;
	decorator: vertical-gradient(#f8e058 #c8b028);
}

/* ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   The tamer's commands (command_menu.c: BTL_renderCommandMenu): a strip at the top left from x 17, y 14, the
   current command's name under it at (20, 48) in the ink colour, the cursor a yellow outline (#f8d000). The original
   draws each command as a 16 x 16 icon of BTLCOMND; the battle's settings name a command's text, not its icon, so
   the strip shows the names, smaller. */

#commands {
	position: absolute;
	left: 51dp;
	top: 42dp;
	width: auto;
	text-align: left;
	padding: 0;
	border-radius: 0;
	border-width: 0;
	background-color: transparent;
}

#command-row {
	display: block;
	margin: 0;
	padding: 0;
	border-radius: 0;
	border-width: 0;
	background-color: transparent;
}

.command {
	display: inline-block;
	margin: 0 6dp 6dp 0;
	padding: 0 9dp;
	font-size: 22dp;
	line-height: 30dp;
	border: 3dp transparent;
	background-color: #00000080;
}

.command:focus, .command.current {
	border-color: #f8d000;
	background-color: #00000080;
	color: #d0d0d0;
}

.command.unavailable {
	color: #828282;
}

#command-name {
	margin: 6dp 0 0 9dp;
	font-size: 33dp;
	color: #d0d0d0;
}

/* ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   The enemies' HP (capture battle_hud_enemy_hp_bar): a 54 x 6 outline in green (#0AB40A) round a light green fill 3
   pixels tall, the value above its right end. The original hangs each bar beside its enemy; the battle does not yet
   publish where an enemy is on the screen, so the bars stand in a column at the top middle (a documented gap). */

#enemies {
	position: absolute;
	right: auto;
	left: 50%;
	top: 120dp;
	width: 240dp;
	margin-left: -120dp;
	padding: 0;
	border-width: 0;
	background-color: transparent;
}

.enemy {
	width: 240dp;
	margin: 0 0 18dp 0;
}

.enemy .fighter-head {
	font-size: 22dp;
	color: #d0d0d0;
}

.enemy .fighter-status {
	margin-left: 9dp;
	font-size: 22dp;
	color: #fff371;
}

.enemy .bar-row {
	display: block;
	position: relative;
	height: 48dp;
}

.enemy .bar-label {
	display: none;
}

.enemy .bar {
	position: absolute;
	left: 0;
	bottom: 0;
	width: 156dp;
	height: 12dp;
	margin: 0;
	border-radius: 0;
	border: 3dp #0ab40a;
	background-color: transparent;
}

.enemy .fill {
	height: 9dp;
	border-radius: 0;
	decorator: horizontal-gradient(#a0e8a0 #e8ffe8);
}

.enemy .bar-value {
	position: absolute;
	left: 96dp;
	top: 0;
	width: 66dp;
	font-size: 33dp;
	line-height: 30dp;
	text-align: right;
}

/* ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   The finisher's charge and the revive countdown: one of the original's boxes and the ink colour. */

#charge {
	border-radius: 0;
	border: 3dp #90d9fa;
	border-right-color: #4a9fc5;
	background-color: #2d384080;
	decorator: image(box-tl scale-none left top) border-box, image(box-tr scale-none right top) border-box,
		image(box-bl scale-none left bottom) border-box, image(box-br scale-none right bottom) border-box;
}

#charge-title {
	font-size: 33dp;
	color: #fff371;
}

#charge .bar {
	height: 9dp;
	border-radius: 0;
	border: 3dp #020202;
	border-right-color: #6987a0;
	border-bottom-color: #6987a0;
	background-color: #354b5c;
}

#charge .fill {
	border-radius: 0;
	decorator: vertical-gradient(#f8e058 #c8b028);
}

.charge-hint {
	font-size: 22dp;
	color: #b2b2b2;
}

#revive {
	font-size: 33dp;
	color: #d0d0d0;
}

#prompts {
	right: 30dp;
	bottom: 18dp;
	padding: 0;
	border-radius: 0;
	font-size: 22dp;
	color: #b2b2b2;
	background-color: transparent;
}

/* ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   The bag in battle: the field bag's box (inventory.c; capture field_item_bag_1item) at the top, with the
   description under it in grey. */

#bag {
	left: 27dp;
	top: 27dp;
	width: 906dp;
	padding: 18dp 15dp;
	border-radius: 0;
	border: 3dp #90d9fa;
	border-right-color: #4a9fc5;
	background-color: #00000080;
	decorator: image(box-tl scale-none left top) border-box, image(box-tr scale-none right top) border-box,
		image(box-bl scale-none left bottom) border-box, image(box-br scale-none right bottom) border-box;
}

#bag h2 {
	font-size: 33dp;
	color: #fff371;
}

.bag-slot {
	width: 414dp;
	height: 54dp;
	margin: 0 18dp 0 0;
	padding: 0 9dp 0 66dp;
	font-size: 33dp;
	line-height: 48dp;
	border: 3dp transparent;
}

.bag-slot:focus {
	border-color: #b0b0b0 #121212 #121212 #b0b0b0;
	background-color: #80808080;
}

.bag-slot.unusable {
	color: #828282;
}

#bag-description {
	font-size: 33dp;
	color: #b2b2b2;
}

#item-in-flight {
	font-size: 33dp;
	color: #d0d0d0;
}

.bag-slot:focus .original-look {
	color: #d0d0d0;
}

/* ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   The end boxes (capture battle_end_box_stats, battle_end_box, battle_end_box_drop): from (73, 36), 174 pixels
   wide, the stat gains in a box 102 tall, the names in yellow (#fff371); the bits in a box under it; the outcome and
   the lines of drops, injury and moves learned in a third box under that. The boxes are black at half opacity. The
   original marks a gain with a blue arrow and the count; here it is "+n". */

#end {
	display: block;
	background-color: transparent;
}

#end-panel {
	position: absolute;
	left: 50%;
	top: 108dp;
	width: 522dp;
	margin-left: -261dp;
	padding: 393dp 0 0 0;
	border-radius: 0;
	border-width: 0;
	background-color: transparent;
}

#end-boxes {
	display: block;
	position: absolute;
	left: 0;
	top: 0;
	width: 522dp;
	margin: 0;
}

#gains, #bits {
	margin: 0 0 3dp 0;
	padding: 6dp 18dp;
	border-radius: 0;
	border: 3dp #90d9fa;
	border-right-color: #4a9fc5;
	background-color: #00000080;
}

#gains {
	height: 288dp;
}

.gain {
	display: block;
	width: auto;
	font-size: 33dp;
	line-height: 45dp;
}

.gain-label {
	color: #fff371;
}

.gain-value {
	float: right;
	margin-right: 18dp;
	color: #90c8f0;
}

#bits {
	width: auto;
	height: 81dp;
	font-size: 33dp;
	line-height: 81dp;
}

#bits-value {
	display: inline;
	margin-left: 60dp;
	text-align: left;
}

#end-title {
	margin: 0;
	padding: 6dp 18dp 0 18dp;
	font-size: 33dp;
	color: #fff371;
	border: 3dp #90d9fa;
	border-bottom-width: 0;
	border-right-color: #4a9fc5;
	background-color: #00000080;
}

.end-line {
	margin: 0;
	padding: 0 18dp;
	font-size: 33dp;
	border: 3dp #90d9fa;
	border-top-width: 0;
	border-bottom-width: 0;
	border-right-color: #4a9fc5;
	background-color: #00000080;
}

/* The original goes on at a button press with nothing on the screen for it; here the "continue" entry closes the
   third box at its bottom right, always focused, so it needs no selector of its own. */
#end-continue, #end-continue:focus {
	margin: 0;
	padding: 0 18dp;
	text-align: right;
	color: #b2b2b2;
	border: 3dp #90d9fa;
	border-top-width: 0;
	border-right-color: #4a9fc5;
	background-color: #00000080;
}
